The password file was hidden inside a subdirectory called `inhere`. Running `ls` only shows visible files, so `ls -la` was needed to reveal the hidden file `...Hiding-From-You` (files prefixed with `.` are hidden in Linux). The file was then read with `cat '... Hiding-From-You'`, using quotes to handle the dots and spaces in the filename.


